  parchmentText: Prince Magnus has ordered that the orc warlord, Ulag, who was responsible
    for the imprisonment of Sir Ragnar, be sought out and destroyed. When Ulag is
    destroyed, the heroes are to be rewarded 180 gold coins to be divided among them.
    Any treasure found in Ulag's stronghold may be kept by the finder alone.
